+/*
+ * xemu-ps4: the PS4 frontend (replaces ui/xemu.c and its SDL window + OpenGL).
+ *
+ *   /app0                     packaged files (eboot.bin, data/: fonts and pictures)
+ *   /data/xemu                xemu.toml, eeprom.bin, logs (boot-trace.log, crash.log, xemu.log)
+ *   /data/xemu/bios           the MCPX boot ROM (512 bytes) and the flash BIOS (256 KiB or 1 MiB)
+ *   /data/xemu/hdd            the hard disk image (xbox_hdd.qcow2)
+ *   /data/xemu/games          games (.iso, XISO)
+ *
+ * The emulator runs on its own thread as on the desktop; this thread presents the Vulkan
+ * renderer's display image on VideoOut (ps4-present.cc) with the HUD and menus drawn by ImGui
+ * (ps4-hud.cc), and polls the pads through SDL (xemu-input.c).
